Obel Mono 1.002. Family name in the Font list: "Obel Mono".

Unmodified copies of the upstream variable fonts from the
ObelMono-1.002-ttf release archive (`variable/`),
https://typographic.systems/obel-mono. Masking rules live in `ccmp`, switched
on by `ss01` ("Mask secrets"); there is no `calt` or `liga`. The font does not
declare itself fixed-pitch, which is why the Font list decides on advance
widths. Also registered for the test process only (`coretext::fixture`).

- `ObelMono[wght].ttf`
  sha256 15e4340c4173bd563966dd1b6254e83d726feec96278d9ba59b2a81b739d9596
- `ObelMono-Italic[wght].ttf`
  sha256 2b5de9a8ceaf2afe5eec9cfa00984a91bbb86f8d7c272ace0f9fb4fb6d9a0b84
- `OFL.txt` (SIL Open Font License 1.1) and `AUTHORS.txt`: from the same archive.
